# Agent instruction files ARE tracked (ADR-0011): a repository's agent
# instructions live in the repository, not in the vault. Keeping them ignored
# left them on one disk only — absent from clones, from the mirrors, and from
# any remote or cloud agent.

/.claudeignore
/.graphifyignore

.claude/
.codex/

# BEGIN never4ga agent instruction files
# Agent instruction files are generated on each machine and never
# committed.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
GEMINI.md
# END never4ga agent instruction files
